   Liu, Danfeng, Yunnan Univ, Inst Biodivers, Sch Ecol \& Environm Sci, Yunnan Key Lab Plant Reprod Adaptat \& Evolutionary, Kunming 650504, Yunnan, Peoples R China.
   Wang, Qi, Wageningen Univ \& Res, Lab Entomol, NL-6700 AA Wageningen, Netherlands.
